---
// "One month, one question": what a WTH is, in three quotes.
import WthIcon from "./WthIcon.astro";
import { forumUrl } from "../lib/wth.mjs";
---

<section id="moments">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="content">
      <h2>One month, one question</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">What in Home Assistant makes you go “what the heck?!”</p>

      <div class="tile-grid">
        <div class="tile">
          <span class="tile-icon" aria-hidden="true"><WthIcon name="mdi:magnify" /></span>
          <p>“I can never find this setting on my dashboard!”</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tile">
          <span class="tile-icon" aria-hidden="true"><WthIcon name="mdi:help-circle-outline" /></span>
          <p>“We don’t know why our home keeps doing that!”</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tile">
          <span class="tile-icon" aria-hidden="true"><WthIcon name="mdi:lightbulb-question-outline" /></span>
          <p>“I can’t believe it’s not possible to do this yet!”</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="section-note">Big or small, post them all on the <a href={forumUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Month of What the Heck?! category</a> on our community forum.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
